        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngosuku lwesithathu uEsta wagqoka izambatho zakhe zobukhosi, wema egumeni elingaphakathi kwesigodlo senkosi, wakhangelana laso isigodlo. Inkosi yayihlezi esihlalweni sayo sobukhosi esigodlweni ikhangele ngasemnyango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi lapho inkosi ibona inkosikazi uEsta imi egumeni, yathokoza ngaye, yamelulela intonga yobukhosi yegolide eyayiyiphethe. Wasesondela uEsta ethinta isihloko sentonga yobukhosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yasisithi kuye: Kuyini, nkosikazi Esta? Ucelani kimi na? Uzanikwa loba kuyingxenye yombuso wami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UEsta wasesithi: Uba kuyithokozisa inkosi, ngiyakucela wena kanye loHamani ukuba lize edilini esengikulungisele lona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yasikhupha ilizwi ukuthi uHamani kalandwe masinyane ukuze kwenziwe okufiswa nguEsta. Inkosi loHamani baya edilini ayeselilungisile uEsta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Besanatha iwayini inkosi yathi kuEsta: Kukhona ofuna ukukucela kimi na? Uzakukunikwa. Kukhona okufisayo na? Loba kuyingxenye yombuso wami, kuzakwenziwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UEsta wathi: Engikucelayo lengikufisayo yilokhu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uba ngifumene umusa emehlweni enkosi, futhi uba kukuhle enkosini ukunginika engikucelayo lengikufisayo, inkosi loHamani kabeze kusasa edilini engizakulenzela lona lina lobabili. Kusasa ngizakwenza lokho inkosi ekutshoyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHamani wasehambake mhlalokho ethokoza elomoya omuhle. Kodwa lapho ebona uMoridekayi ekhona esigodlweni lokuthi kamsukumeli kamnanzi, wathukuthela kakhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa wazithinta, waya ekhaya; wasebiza abangane bakhe loZereshi umkakhe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wabalandisela ngobunengi benotho yakhe langobunengi bamadodana akhe, langokuthi inkosi yamphakamisa yambeka esikhundleni esiphezu kwazo zonke ezinye izikhulu lenceku zenkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi: Kakusikho lokhu kodwa, inkosikazi uEsta kayimemanga muntu ngaphandle kwami ukuba ngiphelekezele inkosi edilini elenzileyo; ungimemile futhi ukuba ngize lenkosi kusasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanti konke lokhu kakusilutho kimi nxa lokhu ngisabona loyana umJuda uMoridekayi elokhu esekhona esigodlweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UZereshi umkakhe labo bonke abangane bakhe bathi kuye: Akumbelwe ugodo ubude balo bube zingalo ezingamatshumi amahlanu, kucelwe enkosini ekuseni ukuba uMoridekayi alengiswe kulo, ubusuhamba lenkosi edilini ulomoya omuhle. UHamani wabona ukuthi lokhu kuhle, waselumbelake ugodo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
